      "writtenOn": "2019-03-01T08:35:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I find that private methods calling transitionTo() tend to obfuscate code in StateMachine subclasses. The reason for this is that when you\u0027re reading the code of a state, you typically expect to see all the edges clearly written there, and this is hiding the edge away.\n\nMy suggestion would be to either :\n- Remove transitionTo() and call it immediately after confirmDhcpLease in every case.\n- Rename this method to confirmDhcpLeaseAndTransitionTo().\n\nI\u0027d be happy with either solution.\n\n+reminv@ you suggested this is refactored together ; do you have any opinion in the light of my comment ?",
